\b How To Use This Tracker\b0\par
1. At the start of each week, set your planned hours and focus.\par
2. Check off learning and implementation items as you complete them.\par
3. Write blockers early so they do not slow you down for multiple days.\par
4. At the end of each week, summarize what worked, what did not, and what to improve next week.\par
